    "reason": "the upper cell forces a landing p >= iterated_isqrt(M_min, r), which is a corollary of even_iter_lt_succ_pow, but the adversarial peak run k=24 lands at p=304. Proved 6/5 RHS=0.002495 and Lean inv-sum S=0.012130 both miss \u03b8=0.002086 / need=0.011568. 6/5 needs p>=659; inv-sum needs p>=367. Pigeonhole k=18 lands at 3075 and would kill; the leftover can choose k=24. Large m is worse. Not a leftover-itinerary census and not a floor raise"
